1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Type a name to jump to it; Enter opens the folder

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:07,000
Alt+P: the preview pane follows the selection

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,400
Space: Quick Look. Up and Down step through the folder

4
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:14,200
Back returns to where the list was; a tar.gz opens like a folder

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:18,300
Code and Markdown preview straight from the archive

6
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:23,300
Ctrl+L: type a path, with completion

7
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:25,100
Ctrl+T: tabs

8
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:29,000
Ctrl+J: a terminal panel under the files

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:36,400
Copy a file, open the pinned server, paste: uploaded over scp

10
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,200
Two-finger swipe right: back, like a browser

11
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:40,500
Right-click: the context menu

12
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,833
Ctrl+Alt+B: the right sidebar
